      <div xml:id="gom-iudic14">
        <head xml:id="gom-iudic14-Hd1e98">Caput 14</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic14-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic14-Hd1e102">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic14-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic14-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic14_5@1-3">Descendit itaque Samson,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic14-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-iudic14-Nd1e110" ref="#IsidoreOfSeville">ISID.</name>, in Jud. tom. V, cap. 8.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic14-Qd1e114">Samson cum ad alienigenas tenderet causa petendae uxoris, leonem occidit: et Christus Ecclesiam vocaturus de gentibus diabolum vicit qui ait: <quote xml:id="gom-iudic14-Qd1e116" source="http://scta.info/resource/io16_33@16-18">Gaudete quia ego vici mundum</quote>. Ex ore leonis occisi favus extrahitur, quia ut conspicimus reges terreni regni, qui contra Christum ante fremuerunt, jam perempta feritate dulcedinem Evangelii praedicant, et munimenta praebent.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
